  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">La Delegation generale a l&apos;Entreprenariat Rapide des Femmes et des Jeunes - Solar Powere</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant provides technical assistance to the group that is receiving a loan through the DER program. Thru this loan, this organization will be able to manage replacement of the diesel well pumps used by local farmers with solar powered pumps. The solar pumps will provide farmers with a reliable source for irrigating agricultural areas, cash crops or nurseries.</narrative>
  </description>
